    "head_commit_message": "docs(spec): slot scatter measured, packing not built (spec 39 step 10e)\n\nBench run #80 (preset=25k scatter=1, 5 rounds) shows no scatter: the 48\nsquads' 49,152 members stay 48 packed runs from where the timing began to\nwhere it ended, since nothing enrols during the fight. 10e is conditional\non scatter worth fixing, so packing isn't built. The spec records the\nnumbers and when to measure again (a battle that enrols mid-fight).\n\nRefs #557. Cascade #727.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011AyPi1UTcYdk6W7eir3zum",
